OL,3,GNEWSAChoke collars and doggy daycare - 
OL,4,Awhat animal welfare reform means for   
OL,5,Ayou                                    
OL,7,FThe use of choke chains and electronic 
OL,8,Fshock collars (e-collars) on cats and  
OL,9,Fdogs could be a thing of the past in   
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.                      
OL,12,FThe proposals are part of a raft of    
OL,13,Fanimal welfare reforms announced by the
OL,14,FDepartment of Environment, Agriculture 
OL,15,Fand Rural Affairs (Daera) earlier this 
OL,16,Fweek, which minister Andrew Muir hopes 
OL,17,Fto have in place before the next       
OL,18,Fassembly election in May.              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
