OL,3,GNEWSAChoke collars and doggy daycare - 
OL,4,Awhat animal welfare reform means for   
OL,5,Ayou                                    
OL,7,FDoggy daycare facilities and those who 
OL,8,Foffer home boarding services for pet   
OL,9,Fowners could also be affected as the   
OL,10,Freforms could see those types of       
OL,11,Festablishments brought under the animal
OL,12,Fboarding licensing regime.             
OL,14,FSue McKee, who runs Doggos Doggy Day   
OL,15,FCare in Dromore, County Down, said she 
OL,16,Fwelcomes any "sensible regulations" but
OL,17,Fhopes the cost of any licence will not 
OL,18,Fhave a "knock-on effect to small       
OL,19,Fbusinesses".                           
